{"version":1,"content":"<p>AMD已經開始為CES 2027預熱了，只不過預熱得相當含蓄。其計算與圖形業務高級副總裁兼總經理Jack Huynh近日發文，説要讓外界提前看一眼「下一個計算時代」。但通篇沒有產品名、沒有規格，連產品品類都沒給一點提示。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1586972.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-18T14:29:59.742205+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":115,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-18T14:18:16+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-18T14:22:57.435954+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-18T14:22:57.435954+00:00","content_hash":"b68c70c62f4d8bd53c581689e05a53b711d74429e1d41f97e33395352f251faa","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}